{"server":"cn","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_02_beg","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_02","title":"垂死的刺","storyCode":"NL-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"d10b46e2d7c8dedd6518532f33ae9c039c3fb196280e65dde7188e848fc6a67c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在骑士们毫无荣耀可言的围攻下，感染者骑士在赛场上遭遇了事故，引发了一系列波澜，而这条新闻也在操纵之下，逐渐被广告声掩盖。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔2 2-1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"喝啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_219","isRemote":false,"text":"你这感染者——竟敢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"退场吧，这里不适合你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_219","isRemote":false,"text":"啧！至少要把你拉出得分圈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"——！唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，分数还在——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？矿石病垃圾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，英格拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"好样的！锈铜！就这样！把他逼出得分圈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"打烂他的手！就这样！别让这个感染者得手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘！小点声！你看那边的观众席......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动地观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊？那块怎么就坐着她一个人......“感染者骑士席位”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"小声点，她往这边看过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，座位之间不是有隔离墙吗？她什么都听不见吧？再说，难道感染者还敢翻过来打我不成？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"这才叫骑士剑术，英格拉，你那直来直往的动作真让人看不下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"啐......感染者杂碎......也敢教训我？等我把你剥皮拆骨......你会后悔的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"（果然是个一点就着的莽夫......就这样等着他失去理智......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔，来了......！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"该死的感染者垃圾——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"——垃圾？我怎么感觉，是你们这些不求上进的骑士，要更弱一点呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"咕，竟然能把我弹开......！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你那把短兵做不到这种事情......是源石技艺，风的法术？还是单纯的推力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"我会告诉你吗？奥尔默·英格拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"你——看我这一击！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"（突然——！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，果然是风吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"看来只是能辅助移动的水平，比起风骑士那种精神病还是差了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"（试探......？他原来不只是个头脑简单的废物吗......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，感染者......你那把剑并没有安装施术单元，你却能施放法术......恶心，你体内肮脏的源石给你带来的法术改变不了胜负......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"血骑士那家伙也是，就因为冒出几个稍微有点虚名的感染者骑士，他就要逼迫普通民众承认感染者吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"监正会对你们也太好了点吧，要懂得感恩戴德，矿石病垃圾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......感恩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"对你们吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，你是什么态度？在卡西米尔最底层匍匐挣扎的感染者，竟然反而看不起骑士贵族们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者......你知道感染者为了一个合法身份要付出多少代价吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我为什么要知道？我只知道你接下来会死得很惨——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道刚产完卵就被捕捉的雌性钳兽有多凶暴吗？你知道，感染者骑士的选拔......是默许杀人的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，“你会死得很惨”，大放厥词啊，奥尔默·英格拉，你只是在享受欺压弱小......你根本不敢倾力厮杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"——你见过被判定为廉价的生命是怎么被处理的吗？骑士贵族垃圾？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"现在还牢牢站在得分圈里的只有五个了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"*卡西米尔粗口*，我花了所有的钱押宝，结果那个废物三十分钟都没进过得分圈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聒噪的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么还有个感染者？那个感染者在和“锈铜”英格拉作战？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！干掉那些肮脏的家伙！英格拉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"英格拉！英格拉！英格拉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么了？地震了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聒噪的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不，是那边那个感染者骑士......她刚才狠狠踹了一脚地面......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些家伙......开始围攻感染者了吗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样！？英格拉，尝到苦头了吗！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......被包围了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"......感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"你不该站在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"呜——！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正经的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者，弃权吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正经的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜欢英格拉的做派，但无论是我的骑士团还是我的家族，都不会容忍感染者与我们同台竞技的耻辱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"你这......净说漂亮话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正经的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"别误会了，最后能站在得分圈里的本来就只有一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正经的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一场乱战，感染者，只不过现在，你似乎成为众矢之的了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"不知死活的小崽子......等我解决感染者之后，就是你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"英格拉阁下......我已经负伤，难以争夺冠军，但至少现在，我们该联手击垮那个感染者奴隶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"这些下贱的感染者，竟敢对骑士大放厥词。你们也是，都知道先前感染者引起的骚动吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"红松骑士团本来就满是嫌疑，传言非法聚集感染者的幕后主使就是他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"利用和我们同台竞技赢得来的财富，去祸害卡瓦莱利亚基乃至整个卡西米尔的安危？我们该纵容这种行为吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......非法感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到的，只是一群无家可归的可怜人，从工厂、农庄和斗兽场被抛弃的可怜人！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"别嚷嚷，感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"你们要是真的这么想，就该乖乖滚去感染者收容地区......而不是留在这里，任人宰割。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"实话实说吧，你，巴不得杀光所有骑士，对吧？你满腔愤怒，渴望复仇，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"那你还等什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"——你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊——哈、哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"废物！我会把你的手折下来，用它扇你耳光！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，不能继续缠斗下去，得先——）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正经的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"......此路不通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......给我让——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"该死......你们在做什么！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是站在这里而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正经的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"这次你无路可逃了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"......哦，盔甲材质不错，否则你的脊梁骨已经断了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎哈......嘎哈......咳、咳咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白为什么骑士协会会允许你们这种人参加特锦赛......你们的血难道不是剧毒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正经的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"......慢着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正经的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者，离开这里，弃权吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正经的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经受了很重的伤，继续下去，你接下来的比赛就全部泡汤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"——闭嘴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你们......道貌岸然的暴徒......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"道貌岸然，你看我道貌岸然吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你可怜兮兮的反抗心还能持续到什么时候，你会跪下求饶的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，裁判呢，这是什么情况！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这群该死的骑士，想要公报私仇吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"英格拉！英格拉！英格拉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"锈铜万岁！卡西米尔万岁！骑士万岁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聒噪的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"让那个感染者爬起来！让他爬起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聒噪的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"让他上啊！让他继续战斗！！让我们看到他的韧性！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘶！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"干嘛、干嘛？你......你别过来啊？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......要我把你丢下去吗？凑近点看？哼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"不......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟然袭击观众！？作为骑士，你竟敢袭击观众？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聒噪的观众","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"安保人员呢！？安保呢！感染者要袭击平民了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这混账！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"还有力气？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——呕......呕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正经的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多了，锈铜，他会死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正经的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然是感染者，但也是注册在案的骑士。我们没必要为了感染者被国民院找麻烦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，你为什么一直在指指点点的！？啊？你以为你是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正经的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"我们之间也总是要分出胜负的，锈铜......这场比赛只有一个获胜者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"正合我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是什么？风？你还想抵抗吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你知道吗，报废的电风扇都比你折腾出的风声要大，感染者，怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"