:"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你们这些感染者——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"请先离开赛场，锈铜骑士阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗组上前，确保没有传染风险后，放进封闭箱内运走，动作快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"红松骑士团——！你们想和这里所有的骑士为敌吗！？啊！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——把他放下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是为了其他骑士和全体观众的安全考虑，请您配合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"锈铜阁下，也请您快点离开这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，肮脏的骑士......我可不想因为矿石病毁了生活......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也是感染者吧？冷静一点，这里可是特锦赛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们看不见他还有一口气吗！？滚开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正经的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静点，你想要挑衅骑士协会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正经的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"这里应该交给医疗人员——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"咳！咳咳咳——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"哈........."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我过去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"别管她......她也是感染者，先安排观众退场。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘿......不太好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"失血......已经是小事了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"感染的地方在作痛......它们在蔓延......好痛......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位尊敬的观众，因赛场突发事件，请随工作人员安排，及时疏散，颁奖典礼将推迟至两小时后举行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"重复一遍——各位尊敬的观众......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......野鬃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......求你......帮我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......索娜会找到你的妻子和女儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......！源石在他的体表蔓延！不能再拖了，立刻装进封闭箱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们要做什么！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"阻绝感染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们......该死的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"艾沃娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"要记住他们每一个人的脸......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"记住......那些骑士......那些卡西米尔人......这些阴狠的凶手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"别放过，他们任何一个......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"轮到你了，快出牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"急什么，让我考虑考虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"你就剩几张牌了你考虑什么啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下面播报一则紧急新闻——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"于今日进行的特锦赛花样竞技单元的夺旗战项目，发生了一起意外——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"由于一位感染者骑士在比赛前瞒报身体情况，并在比赛中负伤后，坚持使用源石技艺——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——在比赛中途当场休克，经抢救无效死亡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"......死亡？死了？死在赛场上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"据悉，相关医疗部门已经完成了赛场清理，竞技场将于翌日消毒后重新投入使用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"截止至事件发生后三个小时，国民院已经接到多条投诉，希望重改感染者骑士法案——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......重改法案？装模作样，他们就是不敢打自己的脸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"血骑士那个时候，他们迫于压力承认了感染者的合法性，要是现在改回去，面子上哪挂得住？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者问题可不是儿戏......“面子”还能影响决策？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"几十年前，骑士贵族们的“面子”，小过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"时代不同了，虽然我不太懂他们在想什么，但无论在任何地方，保护运作规则本身，比客观的结果还优先。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都吃过苦头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"目前，现场已清理完毕，出于安全考虑，所有参赛骑士将在三日内接受医疗检查——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_courtyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对于此次事件，骑士协会同样给予了高度关注。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在，多个骑士团联名向骑士协会建议，感染者的意外死亡，不可控的源石技艺，以及在特锦赛期间存在造成大规模感染的风险——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"喝——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题，玛莉娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"武器的重心调整很完美，我已经很久没有使用过如此得心应手的武器了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟是根据姐姐先前的战斗特意调整的嘛，嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......既然从数据上讲已经初步调整好了，接下来，该稍微实战一下试试手了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅，靠边站点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"两位都不要勉强啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵，不错的眼神，玛嘉烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就该这么认真，玛嘉烈，你要是敢放水，我的自尊心可是会受伤的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"那么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——对此，我们请到了多位骑士竞技专家发表了自己的看法，请连线骑士协会负责人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，各位卡西米尔的市民，上午好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——感染者可以不依赖施术单元而施法，这在医疗领域已经有了浅显的结论——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是放在赛场上，这是“极不公平”的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（......公平。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......公平吗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nearllivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"想在规则中战胜规则的主人？痴人说梦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_courtyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......好、好啦，快松手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，很久没有用过长柄武器了，火候还不到家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——玛、莉、娅？你在笑什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，啊，对不起，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......玛嘉烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的变了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？有吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是说外表啦，头发又乱了，过来，我帮你梳理一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅，把梳子拿过来。在你的工作台后面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......坐吧，休息一会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是......感觉离你上次离开，也就是一眨眼的功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（一眨眼的功夫......你又离我们更远了......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——据悉，死亡的感染者似乎与非法感染者事件有所牵连，相关情况仍在调查中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"骑士协会承诺，绝不会因为一些小小的风波，导致特锦赛赛程受到影响——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐......那个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是英格拉吗......在赛场上杀死对手，这种事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屏幕里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——现在，参与感染者骑士相关赛事的观众，纷纷要求骑士协会作出处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屏幕里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"与此同时，本次事件的直接参与人，“锈铜”奥尔默·英格拉等数位骑士也接受了采访——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"您在听吗？马克维茨先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉，朱维尔，你接着说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"是。其实是来自骑士协会的一份表单，里面记录了本次比赛所有大骑士的个人资料和注意事项。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"联合会也不希望和这些大明星们搞坏了关系，所以希望我们多加注意吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（都是些老牌选手......唔，果然耀骑士也在其中吗......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位“逐魇骑士”也没有骑士团所属？我本以为打入特锦赛还不属于任何骑士团的特例只有耀骑士一人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，“逐魇骑士”......一般来说大骑士的封号都是言简意赅的单字封号吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他还不是大骑士？那他有什么特别之处吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这位啊......哈哈。这位可让骑士协会头疼了许久，虽然我不太明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"他本人对骑士封号一类的事情完全不在意，对于联合会的安排也是置之不理，但是也不会刻意违抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"是个怪人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪人吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"是，不过他的实力毋庸置疑，而且不知为何，似乎有一些骑士家族对他的身份很好奇，已经来协会问过很多次啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我们也不是很清楚他的底细，似乎是从靠近萨尔贡那里的某个乡下来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"马克维茨先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了，你先走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......对了，朱维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？您说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是你认识的那个马克维茨......不用对我这么拘谨，挺不习惯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......遵命，我是说，明白，马克维茨......先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"对此，国民院究竟如何判决？特锦赛开幕首日就遭遇重大意外事件，骑士协会又会如何处理？\n广告之后，我们将为您带来骑士协会的记者招待会的现场直播。\n——噔噔♪♪\n蓝耳酒窖，三百年传承之选，属于骑士之味——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["玛嘉烈"]}]}
